.TH MYSTRCPY 3 "September 2026" "BSDSF24M059-OS-A01" "Library Functions"

.SH NAME
mystrcpy \- copy a string to a destination

.SH SYNOPSIS
.B int mystrcpy(char* dest, const char* src);

.SH DESCRIPTION
.B mystrcpy
copies the string pointed to by
.I src
into the memory pointed to by
.I dest
and returns an integer status value.

